{"2532300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Weird Dream", "steam_appid": 2532300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAQ</h2><strong>Q: My controller isn't responding?</strong><br>A: Please confirm the controller is connected to your pc, or re-plug it and see if it works. If not, try right click the game from your steam library - properties - controller, and turn the override off if it's on. We are currently looking into this issue and working on it around clock, so please keep the game up to date.<br><br><strong>Q: How do I remove the barrier from the TV boss?</strong><br>A: Try do combos and accumulate energy for your ultimate attack, as it can break the barrier.<br><br><strong>Q: I'm lost, where do I go?</strong><br>A: There are guides available in steam community. Try looking it up for hints.<br><br>The Weird Dream is a 2D Metroidvania game set in the ruins of Alpha City. Control a mysterious bunny while confronting Alpha City’s mutated inhabitants. Level up your skills, and unravel the truth behind the City’s untimely destruction. The city holds many legends about the origin of a being only known as the Astral Lord, yet they all share a common detail: the Astral Lord answers sincere prayers and fulfills every desire.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Impeccably Tight Controls</strong> - Use a combination of in-game abilities, rhythm, and your own reflexes to traverse a skill-demanding world with controls that are easy to learn and less easy to master!<br></li><li><strong>Flexible Character Building</strong> - Unlock and experiment with new abilities to forge your unique combat style via an adaptable rune system<br></li><li><strong>Fragmented narratives</strong> - Uncover the dark secrets of this world by collecting monster profiles and story fragments<br></li><li><strong>Exciting Boss Fights</strong> - Challenge over 40 bosses. 